# Ali from Cairo works until it leaves the battlefield (the ruling: "if he takes lethal damage ... at the same time you
# take damage, the ability helps you"). Bot1, at 1 life, blocks one of Bot2's two attacking Memnites with Ali: the combat
# damage is dealt at once (CR 510.2), Ali takes lethal damage and the unblocked Memnite's 1 damage leaves Bot1 at 1. Ali
# then dies (CR 704.5g), and Bot2's Lightning Bolt afterwards is not replaced: Bot1 goes to -2 and loses (CR 704.5a).

[Life]
Bot1: 1

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Ali from Cairo
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ali from Cairo.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite#1 > Bot1; Memnite#2 > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Ali from Cairo > Memnite#1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ali from Cairo = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = -2
Bot1.Status = Lost
Bot1.Graveyard = Ali from Cairo; Black Lotus
